# 中屏 (an opened fold upright), a finger: the conversation brought over the chats by its tape at the window's end (as
# src/sfapp/kept_rows_kinds_wbtest.mbt's kept_rows_open does), then four one-second drags through it and let it coast.
# (Measured from about the same display frame as the other drives: the tape tapped as the app shows.) Its last words are seen before, and gone after: the drags hit the conversation and scrolled it.
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 发消息
tapxy -28 420
wait 500
until 第 2998 步跑完了
log measure
drag -150 300 0 430 1000
drag -150 300 0 430 1000
drag -150 300 0 430 1000
drag -150 300 0 430 1000
wait 317
gone 第 2998 步跑完了
exit
